{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>As Rachel and as Leah.</b> He put Rachel first, because she was Jacob's wife in the beginning of his thought." "<b>And do valor.</b> Like \"do for me this valor,\" for you did not take her for money. [n: Ibn Ezra quotes from the same verse, Ruth 4:11, where the phrase ועשה חיל parallels עשה לי את החיל הזה in v. 10.]"], :book :ruth, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ruth -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ruth"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:34.677893043Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}